  articleID: www.newmanila.gov.ph/services/dogshelter/events
  title: 'Puppy Play Date '
  bodyText: "LOCAL NEWS: The City Dog Shelter is hosting an all-day Puppy Play Date!\r\n\r\nBy
    Maya Lin & Austin Rivera | New Manila Local News\r\n\r\nNeed a shot of happiness
    ? The New Manila City Dog Shelter is opening its doors for an all-day Puppy Play
    Date this October 25th ! Local residents can drop in to play with rescue pups
    and even adopt if you find your match !\r\n\r\n\r\n#LocalNews #CityDogShelter
    #PuppyPlayDate #AdoptLocal #CommunityEvent\r\n\nMunicipal Event Briefing: Citywide
    All-Day Puppy Play Date & Adoption Fair\r\n\r\nThe New Manila City Dog Shelter
    invites local residents to participate in our quarterly All-Day Puppy Play Date.
    This municipal initiative promotes early canine behavioral socialization, public
    education on humane pet ownership, and rehoming opportunities for eligible rescue
    puppies.\r\n\r\nKey Event Details\r\nInformation Field\r\nOfficial Event Details\r\nDate
    & Time\r\nSaturday, October 24, 2026 | 9:00 AM \u2013 4:30 PM\r\nLocation\r\n
    New Manila City Dog Shelter\r\nAdmission Fee\r\nFree (Mandatory online pre-registration
    required)\r\nPortal Link\r\nwww.newmanila.gov.ph/services/dogshelter/events\r\n\r\r\n"
